		weight = 1,
		weatherDesc = 'Rain (Increases speed for Water element pets, reduces damage from Fire element pets, at the end of each major round removes some negative effects from all pets) /n Snow (Doubles defense for Ice element pets, all pets not belonging to Ice element receive Ice elemental damage at the end of each major round and may be Frozen)',
